.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH vmexec-logs 1  "logs " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
vmexec\-logs \- Show terminal log of an existing virtual machine
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBvmexec logs\fR [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-follow\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIVMID\fR> 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Show terminal log of an existing virtual machine
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-follow\fR
Follow log output
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIVMID\fR>
Identifier of a virtual machine
